    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a40">

                <pb facs="0572" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg522"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 40.—To the legation of Portugal at
                        Buenos Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-17"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 17,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Portuguese Government feels that it can not accede to the petition of the
                    Government of Uruguay; but having declared to the Brazilian Government, when
                    that Government demanded surrender of refugees and the Portuguese Government
                    refused it, that it would disembark them only on Portuguese territory. It can
                    not default from the declaration it made.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hintze Ribeiro.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
